Package: pnadcpainel
Title: Painel Consolidado Pessoa e Domicilio da PNAD Continua
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Giordano", "Bueno", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "giordanobueno@gmail.com")
Description: Baixa microdados da PNAD Continua (IBGE), aplica a metodologia
    de identificacao longitudinal de domicilios e individuos do Data Zoom (PUC-Rio),
    cruza a base trimestral com a base de Visita 1 (domicilios) e realiza
    diagnostico e balanceamento do painel.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    PNADcIBGE
Imports:
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    stringr,
    magrittr,
    rlang,
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr,
    lintr,
    rcmdcheck,
    arrow
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
